  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1243:b001:l002": "Stars proved fires: visual misidentification in enormous night army, not stars literally burning on earth.",
    "manas-2010:p1243:b001:l019": "Arkesken retained as sword name, recurrent capitalized weapon designation in this witness. No unsupported all-cutting etymology; possible relationship to наркескен not silently imposed.",
    "manas-2010:p1243:b001:l021": "сан epic multitude unit rendered vast host/army; no invented exact census.",
