    "manas-2010:p1243:b001:l031": "калчаI.1–2 grim/terrible appearance and Kongurbay epithet, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калча/. English grim-faced here and subsequent standalone epithet references; not mountain-Tajik ethnic identification in this context.",
