    "manas-2010:p1245:b001:l015": "сында жок perfect/without fault, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/сын/. Chief peerless, not silently changing сында to санда uncountable.",
    "manas-2010:p1245:b001:l028": "Bozkertik appears here as Ylama’s mount; earlier named fighter Bozkertik also exists. Printed name/function retained without assuming one identity or correcting the text.",
    "manas-2010:p1246:b001:l006": "Jutting fangs attach to dead horses on following line; mustaches attach to dead men1246:8–9, repeated1249:34–37. No omission as grotesque detail.",
    "manas-2010:p1246:b001:l026": "табы leopard breed/type provisionally, following fighting trim at1246:23; contextual repetition retains both values.",
    "manas-2010:p1247:b001:l004": "уй куймулчак lean cow-like rump is racing-horse conformation, exact Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/куймулчак/; not fat bovine hindquarters.",
    "manas-2010:p1247:b001:l013": "Roe-deer-like head provisionally Sarala from preceding grammatical subject; rider assignment possible, qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1247:b001:l030": "кесерден horse-chest depth, Yudakhin ат кесерден https://el-sozduk.kg/кесер/; ат implicit in this shortened formula. Not an unverified king Kesar.",
