    "manas-2010:p1248:b001:l028": "күрмө sleeveless garment, source glossary1839:39 and Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/күрмө/. Karykan/Esenkan ownership swaps at1248:35/37 retained explicitly.",
    "manas-2010:p1248:b001:l030": "Isolated жай ташын is a wrapped verse display line, retained separately with English magic stone; preceding line supplies weather-conjuring modifier. Not a heading.",
