    "manas-2010:p1250:b001:l022": "кара байыр ordinary/plain classification, Yudakhin байыр→карабайыр; санатII number/category https://el-sozduk.kg/байыр/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/санат/. Horse-breed sense possible but military classification strongly favors ordinary ranks; qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1250:b001:l025": "өң provisionally selected/chosen in separated marksmen context; exact modifier uncertain, no change to printed өң.",
