    "manas-2010:p1250:b001:l034": "мөндү = Come, source-edition glossary1841:4–6 explicitly Kalmyk кел and battle cry. Three repetitions preserved; same gloss1250:35. Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/мөндү/ confirms war-cry usage.",
    "manas-2010:p1250:b001:l038": "жабууIII Mongol/Kalmyk war cry, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/жабуу/ explicitly compares жабыII greeting well-being https://el-sozduk.kg/жабы/. Hail is qualified English greeting/cry equivalent, not coverlet. All three repetitions retained; no claim this reconstructs historical Mongolian wording.",
