    "manas-2010:p1252:b001:l012": "аккаңкы Mongol-type saddle with broad curved front bow, Yudakhin/1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/каңкы/. Rendered broad-pommeled saddle, not unverified proper saddle name.",
    "manas-2010:p1252:b001:l014": "окоро түйгөн tied in rounded knots, source glossary1841:31 and1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/окоро/. Repeated1252:42; not loose reins.",
