    "manas-2010:p1253:b001:l031": "Сырбараң polished musket weapon gloss, no unsupported ignition type. At1253:37 struck could mean shot or close blow; source does not settle which.",
    "manas-2010:p1254:b001:l019": "Ачболот literally hungry steel, sword designation rendered hungry steel sword. Could be proper weapon name; English gloss preserves imagery.",
    "manas-2010:p1254:b001:l029": "1245/1254 absent-Manas rhetoric retained: challenge that Chinese try taking life with Manas present, not wish for death necessarily. Entrusted life preserves аманат.",
